## [1.0.0] - {{YYYY-MM-DD}}

### Added
- Initial production release
- Wycena robocizny ryczałtowej (pozycje kosztorysowe dekarskie)
- Wykaz drewna konstrukcyjnego (8 typów, formaty AxBxC, jednostki mb/szt/m³)
- Generowanie 2 PDF: oferta + wykaz drewna (`@react-pdf/renderer`, polska typografia)
- Archiwum ofert z wyszukiwaniem po nazwisku klienta
- Single-user auth: iron-session + bcryptjs (cost 12) + zxcvbn (score ≥3)
- TOTP optional (feature flag `TOTP_REQUIRED`, default: false)
- Audit trail: snapshot każdej oferty (PDF + JSON + MD5 + timestamp ISO) — immutable

### Security
- TLS: Caddy v2 auto-TLS Let's Encrypt (HSTS preload, max-age=31536000)
- CSP nonce-based via Next.js middleware (no unsafe-inline scripts)
- Security headers: X-Frame-Options DENY, X-Content-Type-Options nosniff, Referrer-Policy strict-origin-when-cross-origin
- Rate limiting: Caddy (1000 req/min per IP) + Hono (login: 5/15min, PDF: 30/hour)
- pg_dump daily backup → Backblaze B2 (encrypted at rest, 7d/4w/12m retention)
- gitleaks pre-commit hook (secret detection)
- OWASP ZAP baseline scan w CI (weekly + push)
- Trivy container scan w CI (HIGH+CRITICAL → fail)
- CodeQL static analysis (JS/TS)
- SBOM: cyclonedx-bom w CI artifacts

